    {"id":"node-garbes-vardu-komisija","kind":"body","label":{"lt":"Emeritūros, afiliacijos ir garbės vardų komisija","en":"Emeritus, Affiliation and Honours Commission"},"description":{"lt":"Svarsto ir teikia Senatui tvirtinti kandidatūras gauti Universiteto profesoriaus emerito, afiliuotojo profesoriaus, docento, mokslo darbuotojo bei garbės daktaro, alumni, mecenato vardus.","en":"Considers and submits nominations to the Senate for approval for the University’s titles of professor emeritus, affiliated professor, associate professor, research fellow, honorary doctor, alumnus and patron."},"url":"https://www.vu.lt/site_files/Emerituros_afiliacijos_ir_garbes_vardu_nuostatai.pdf","handles":[],"width":150,"position":{"x":12,"y":162},"parentNode":"parent-node-senato-komisijos","height":58},
