    {"id":"node-darbo-grupes","kind":"body","label":{"lt":"Rektoriaus sudaromos darbo grupės","en":"Working Groups Formed by the Rector"},"description":{"lt":"Rektorius taip pat gali steigti darbo grupes tam tikriems klausimams spręsti. Darbo grupės yra trumpalaikės ir sudarytos iki reikiamo sprendimo priėmimo (pavyzdžiui, Statuto parengimo, modulinių studijų įvedimo ir kt.).","en":"The Rector may also establish working groups to address specific issues. These are temporary and operate until the required decision is made, for example on drafting the Statute or introducing modular studies."},"handles":["left"],"width":180,"position":{"x":195,"y":140},"height":44},
